{"seq":2,"slug":"business-and-health","title":"商业与健康争议","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/business-and-health","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"controversial-business-practices","title":"有争议的商业行为","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/business-and-health/controversial-business-practices","wordCount":1889,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-illness-and-its-handling","title":"疾病与他的应对","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/business-and-health/the-illness-and-its-handling","wordCount":1762,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 商业与健康争议\n\n乔布斯的争议，也体现在苹果的商业实践与他对自身健康的应对上。本章考察这两个层面。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"有争议的商业行为\"——封闭生态、供应链劳工与强硬竞争等，构成其商业遗产不可回避的另一面。第二篇文档讲述\"疾病与他的应对\"，回顾他延误治疗的决定，如何揭示天才也会被自身性格弱点所拖累。\n"}